 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "No motif on the Prophet ﷺ; a book for «ما أنزل», geometric for «والله يعصمك». 67:9-14 «وإن لم تفعل فما بلغت رسالته» carries As-Sa'di's «فبلغ… أكمل تبليغ». 69 carries Al-Muyassar's condition: the faith meant is tawhid and belief in Muhammad ﷺ and what he brought. 69:6 «الصابئون» not glossed (the tafsirs define them differently). STAGING v4: 67 stays ambient (the Prophet commanded to convey); the mood moves from dawn to night sky because 67:19-24 is about the disbelievers. 68-69: a town by day; the People of the Book (two, plus one more of them who stays still) face two believers; nobody speaks the Prophet's words or faces an empty side. Only part of them acts: the two shake their heads on 68:17 and turn away on 68:24 (increase in transgression and denial); the third stays still; all three leave on 69:1. 69: the believers pray on 69:13 (righteous deeds) and prostrate on 69:16 with nobody in front of them; a seal plate on 69:15 (the promise); nothing literal for the Day."
 },
